0..38 Comment "// This source shows inert operations."
39..41 Comment "//"
42..104 Comment "// An inert operation identifies a package. It does not define"
105..128 Comment "// the package content."
129..131 Comment "//"
132..207 Comment "// The checker allows a manifest step and another inert declaration to read"
208..273 Comment "// it. A top-level definition marked inert is such a declaration."
